    "title": "Virginia Man Convicted of Murder After Claiming Girlfriend Shot Herself - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caleb Ward ,\n1 days ago FAIRFAX, Va. — A Lorton man has been convicted of murder after prosecutors proved he lied about how his girlfriend died, rejecting his claim that she shot herself. A Fairfax County jury found Huy Tien “Max” Nguyen, 48, guilty of second-degree murder and a firearm charge in the April 2024 death of his girlfriend, Alison “Kate” LaPorta, 38. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
